; Lots priced in a commodity that a later `alias` retires value through
; the referent's prices.  The price lookup's target is then the retired
; commodity, whose graph vertex holds the referent; MSFT reaches it over
; two hops (MSFT -> USD -> JPY).  -V states the result in the retired
; commodity, as it was written in the lot price (alias-after-price.test
; pins the same rule for NOK); -X JPY states it in the referent.

2024/01/01 Buy
    A    10 AAPL {5 Yen}
    B

2024/01/01 Buy two hops
    M    20 MSFT {3 Yen}
    B

commodity JPY
    alias Yen

P 2024/01/05 AAPL 600 JPY
P 2024/01/05 MSFT 10.00 USD
P 2024/01/05 USD 150 JPY

test bal ^A ^M -V --now 2024/02/01
             Yen6000  A
            Yen30000  M
--------------------
            Yen36000
end test

test bal ^A ^M -X JPY --now 2024/02/01
             JPY6000  A
            JPY30000  M
--------------------
            JPY36000
end test
